WEBVTT

00:09:57.116 --> 00:10:00.045
dhe pikerisht pse e dua shtetin tim, po e bej kete.

00:10:00.045 --> 00:10:02.910
Sepse besoj se nje shoqeri nuk do te jete e lire

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:05.453
nese grate e asaj shoqerie nuk jane te lira.

00:10:05.453 --> 00:10:15.382
(Duartrokitje)

00:10:15.382 --> 00:10:17.734
Faleminderit.

00:10:17.734 --> 00:10:20.550
(Duartrokitje)

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:23.174
Faleminderit, faleminderit, faleminderit, faleminderit.

00:10:23.174 --> 00:10:35.938
(Duartrokitje)